        "I seek Allah's forgiveness. O Allah, You are Peace and from You comes peace; blessed are You, O Possessor of majesty and honour." to "Ik zoek de vergiffenis van Allah. O Allah, U bent Vrede en van U komt vrede; gezegend bent U, O Bezitter van majesteit en eer.",
